---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { getLangFromUrl } from "../../../i18n/utils";

export async function getStaticPaths() {
    return [{ params: { locale: "en" } }, { params: { locale: "it" } }];
}

const locale = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);

const content = {
    en: {
        title: "Kotlin Multiplatform Warehouse App",
        subtitle:
            "Rebuilding a 12-year-old system into a modular, shareable platform",
        period: "2024 - Present",
        overview:
            "I rebuilt a legacy warehouse management app from the ground up using Kotlin Multiplatform. The old codebase was tangled after years of ad-hoc patches; the new approach focuses on a small, well-tested core and client-specific modules so teams can ship changes faster without stepping on each other's work.",
        challenge:
            "The original app started on Windows Mobile, then shifted to Android with Java and XML over many years. It worked, but adding features or supporting a new client meant long, risky changes. Each customer had a slightly different fork and that made maintenance painful.",
        solution:
            "I picked Kotlin Multiplatform to share logic across Android, iOS, desktop, and the web. I split the product into a core library and optional modules so a new client can reuse the core and only add the pieces they need. That reduced duplication and made releases predictable.",
        keyAchievements: [
            {
                title: "Practical modular design",
                description:
                    "Built a small core library for shared domain logic and separate modules for client-specific behavior. That made it possible to evolve the core independently from client customizations.",
            },
            {
                title: "ERP integrations",
                description:
                    "Integrated with Oracle JDE and NetSuite so the same app can run in different environments without heavy rewrites.",
            },
            {
                title: "Fast path to production",
                description:
                    "Delivered the first production rollout in about three months and scaled to multiple clients shortly after.",
            },
            {
                title: "Web distribution via WASM",
                description:
                    "Added WebAssembly support so parts of the app can be served in a browser, reducing the need for frequent client updates.",
            },
            {
                title: "Hands-on technical leadership",
                description:
                    "Acted as sole technical lead for the business unit, working directly with clients to shape priorities and avoid building features nobody needed.",
            },
        ],
        technologies: [
            { name: "Kotlin", proficiency: "Expert" },
            { name: "Kotlin Multiplatform", proficiency: "Expert" },
            { name: "WebAssembly", proficiency: "Intermediate" },
            { name: "Oracle JDE", proficiency: "Intermediate" },
            { name: "NetSuite", proficiency: "Intermediate" },
            { name: "Ktor", proficiency: "Intermediate" },
        ],
        techStack: {
            title: "Technical stack",
            items: [
                {
                    category: "Language",
                    items: ["Kotlin", "Kotlin Multiplatform"],
                },
                {
                    category: "Platforms",
                    items: ["Android", "iOS", "Web (WASM)", "Desktop"],
                },
                {
                    category: "Networking",
                    items: ["gRPC", "REST APIs", "OAuth2"],
                },
                {
                    category: "ERP integration",
                    items: ["Oracle JDE APIs", "NetSuite APIs"],
                },
                { category: "Storage", items: ["SQLite", "PostgreSQL"] },
                {
                    category: "Dev tools",
                    items: ["IntelliJ IDEA", "Gradle", "GitHub"],
                },
            ],
        },
        metrics: [
            { label: "Clients in production", value: "2+" },
            { label: "Custom modules", value: "6+" },
            { label: "Time to first production", value: "3 months" },
            { label: "Shared code", value: "~65%" },
        ],
        learnings: [
            "A small, well-tested core prevents most duplication and makes shipping safer.",
            "Talking to the actual users early avoids building shiny features no one needs.",
            "Kotlin Multiplatform lets you share business logic without forcing one UI stack on everyone.",
            "WASM can be surprisingly useful for distribution when you want to avoid frequent client updates.",
        ],
    },
    it: {
        title: "App Magazzino Kotlin Multiplatform",
        subtitle:
            "Reimplementazione di un sistema di 12 anni in una piattaforma modulare",
        period: "2024 - Presente",
        overview:
            "Ho riscritto un'applicazione di gestione magazzino legacy usando Kotlin Multiplatform. Il vecchio codice era diventato difficile da estendere: ora ho ridotto la complessità con una libreria core snella e moduli client-specifici, così ogni team può rilasciare più velocemente senza conflitti.",
        challenge:
            "L'app era nata su Windows Mobile e poi è stata portata su Android con Java e XML. Dopo anni di modifiche rapide, ogni cliente aveva variazioni e mantenere tutto era costoso e rischioso.",
        solution:
            "Ho scelto Kotlin Multiplatform per condividere la logica tra Android, iOS, desktop e web. Ho separato il progetto in un core testato e moduli opzionali: per un nuovo cliente basta riusare il core e aggiungere i moduli necessari, evitando fork e duplicazioni.",
        keyAchievements: [
            {
                title: "Design modulare e pratico",
                description:
                    "Libreria core per la logica condivisa e moduli indipendenti per le personalizzazioni cliente. Questo permette di far evolvere il core senza toccare ogni implementazione.",
            },
            {
                title: "Integrazioni ERP",
                description:
                    "Integrazione con Oracle JDE e NetSuite, così la stessa app funziona in diversi contesti senza riscritture estese.",
            },
            {
                title: "Percorso veloce alla produzione",
                description:
                    "Primo rollout in produzione in circa tre mesi; abbiamo rapidamente aggiunto altri clienti.",
            },
            {
                title: "Distribuzione web con WASM",
                description:
                    "Aggiunto supporto WebAssembly per distribuire parti dell'app via browser, riducendo la necessità di aggiornamenti lato client.",
            },
            {
                title: "Leadership tecnica pratica",
                description:
                    "Ho ricoperto il ruolo di tech lead, confrontandomi direttamente con i clienti per definire priorità realistiche.",
            },
        ],
        technologies: [
            { name: "Kotlin", proficiency: "Expert" },
            { name: "Kotlin Multiplatform", proficiency: "Expert" },
            { name: "WebAssembly", proficiency: "Intermedio" },
            { name: "Oracle JDE", proficiency: "Intermedio" },
            { name: "NetSuite", proficiency: "Intermedio" },
            { name: "Ktor", proficiency: "Intermedio" },
        ],
        techStack: {
            title: "Stack tecnologico",
            items: [
                {
                    category: "Linguaggio",
                    items: ["Kotlin", "Kotlin Multiplatform"],
                },
                {
                    category: "Piattaforme",
                    items: ["Android", "iOS", "Web (WASM)", "Desktop"],
                },
                {
                    category: "Networking",
                    items: ["gRPC", "REST APIs", "OAuth2"],
                },
                {
                    category: "Integrazione ERP",
                    items: ["Oracle JDE APIs", "NetSuite APIs"],
                },
                { category: "Storage", items: ["SQLite", "PostgreSQL"] },
                {
                    category: "Strumenti",
                    items: ["IntelliJ IDEA", "Gradle", "GitHub"],
                },
            ],
        },
        metrics: [
            { label: "Clienti in produzione", value: "2+" },
            { label: "Moduli personalizzati", value: "6+" },
            { label: "Tempo al primo rilascio", value: "3 mesi" },
            { label: "Codice condiviso", value: "~65%" },
        ],
        learnings: [
            "Un core piccolo e ben testato riduce la duplicazione e i problemi in produzione.",
            "Parlare con gli utenti reali evita di costruire funzionalità che nessuno usa.",
            "Kotlin Multiplatform permette di condividere la logica senza imporre una sola UI.",
            "WASM è uno strumento pratico quando vuoi evitare aggiornamenti client frequenti.",
        ],
    },
};

const page = content[locale];
---

<BaseLayout>
    <div
        class="min-h-screen bg-primary dark:bg-secondary text-secondary dark:text-primary"
    >
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-20">
            <div class="mb-4">
                <span
                    class="text-sm font-medium text-secondary/60 dark:text-primary/60"
                    >{page.period}</span
                >
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">{page.title}</h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-secondary/80 dark:text-primary/80 mb-8">
                {page.subtitle}
            </p>
            <p
                class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-secondary/75 dark:text-primary/75"
            >
                {page.overview}
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Challenge & Solution -->
        <div
            class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-16 border-t border-secondary/20 dark:border-primary/20"
        >
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
                        {locale === "it" ? "Sfida" : "Challenge"}
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-secondary/75 dark:text-primary/75 leading-relaxed"
                    >
                        {page.challenge}
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
                        {locale === "it" ? "Soluzione" : "Solution"}
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-secondary/75 dark:text-primary/75 leading-relaxed"
                    >
                        {page.solution}
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Achievements -->
        <div
            class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-16 border-t border-secondary/20 dark:border-primary/20"
        >
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-8">
                {locale === "it" ? "Risultati Chiave" : "Key Achievements"}
            </h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                {
                    page.keyAchievements.map((achievement) => (
                        <div class="border-l-2 border-secondary/30 dark:border-primary/30 pl-6 py-2">
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">
                                {achievement.title}
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-secondary/70 dark:text-primary/70 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                {achievement.description}
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    ))
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Metrics -->
        <div
            class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-16 border-t border-secondary/20 dark:border-primary/20"
        >
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-8">
                {locale === "it" ? "Impatto" : "Impact"}
            </h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                {
                    page.metrics.map((metric) => (
                        <div class="text-center">
                            <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-secondary dark:text-primary mb-2">
                                {metric.value}
                            </p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-secondary/60 dark:text-primary/60">
                                {metric.label}
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    ))
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tech Stack -->
        <div
            class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-16 border-t border-secondary/20 dark:border-primary/20"
        >
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-8">{page.techStack.title}</h2>
            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                {
                    page.techStack.items.map((section) => (
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-3 text-secondary dark:text-primary">
                                {section.category}
                            </h3>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                                {section.items.map((item) => (
                                    <span class="px-3 py-1 text-sm bg-secondary/10 dark:bg-primary/10 rounded-full text-secondary dark:text-primary">
                                        {item}
                                    </span>
                                ))}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    ))
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Technologies -->
        <div
            class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-16 border-t border-secondary/20 dark:border-primary/20"
        >
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-8">
                {locale === "it" ? "Tecnologie Usate" : "Technologies Used"}
            </h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                {
                    page.technologies.map((tech) => (
                        <div class="p-4 border border-secondary/20 dark:border-primary/20 rounded-lg">
                            <p class="font-medium text-secondary dark:text-primary">
                                {tech.name}
                            </p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-secondary/60 dark:text-primary/60">
                                {tech.proficiency}
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    ))
                }
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Learnings -->
        <div
            class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-16 border-t border-secondary/20 dark:border-primary/20 mb-20"
        >
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-4">
                {locale === "it" ? "Lezioni Chiave" : "Key Learnings"}
            </h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-secondary/75 dark:text-primary/75">
                {
                    page.learnings.map((item) => (
                        <li class="flex gap-3">
                            <span class="text-secondary dark:text-primary">
                                ▸
                            </span>
                            <span class="leading-relaxed">{item}</span>
                        </li>
                    ))
                }
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
